This directory contains Expert Advisors (EAs) built using various MetaTrader 5 built-in indicators such as Moving Average, RSI, MACD, Stochastic, and more.
Each EA demonstrates how to:
1. Integrate and use a specific built-in indicator in MQL5
2. Generate entry and exit signals
3. Apply basic risk management tools (SL, TP, etc.)
This collection is perfect for learning how to automate strategies using built-in tools in MT5. New EAs will be added regularly as I explore more indicators.

